OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife trust secures 600-acre
OL,4,Alandmark site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildlife trust is celebrating after
OL,7,Fit was gifted 600 acres of land, the
OL,8,Flargest piece of land it has ever
OL,9,Fsecured.
OL,11,FThe site at Eyam Moor - which covers an
OL,12,Farea equivalent to about 375 football
OL,13,Fpitches in the Wild Peak - is crossed
OL,14,Fby a number of footpaths and will be
OL,15,Ffree for the public to visit, while
OL,16,Fbeing managed by Derbyshire Wildlife
OL,17,FTrust.
OL,19,FThe trust said the new site would form
OL,20,Fpart of a wildlife corridor spanning
OL,21,Fmore than 1,000 acres and encompasses a
OL,22,Fvariety of habitats.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
