OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife trust secures 600-acre
OL,4,Alandmark site
OL,5,
OL,6,FJoanna Hill, Wild Peak programme
OL,7,Fmanager for the trust, said the site
OL,8,Fwas "very kindly" gifted by the
OL,9,Fprevious landowners, who wished to
OL,10,Fremain anonymous.
